{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/toolpath-md/src/lib.rs","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-07T16:22:35.763768Z","id":"6dbd5cfac6540847db9916b81eae44da65a563c093bb80ebd231228075a70ea5","body":{"detail":"crates/toolpath-md/src/lib.rs:531-537 (and the other two header writers at 973-980 and 1255-1260) emit `**Base:**` from `path.path.base` and nothing from `path.path.parent`; crates/toolpath-dot/src/lib.rs:93-131 draws a `__base__` node into each root step and nothing for `parent`. Running `path p render md --input examples/path-05-continuation.path.json` on this branch yields a header with Base, Head and Source only, although the document's whole point is that step-004 continues step-003 of path-session-xyz. `p render md` is documented as the rendering \"for LLM consumption\" (`path p render --help`), so an LLM reading a resumed session cannot see that it is one.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":531},"end":{"line":537},"content_hash":"ea9d434d5caf563ffaf29ba21bdcb1b1ed6a79275a68af6a3ce00a9630e4fc4d"},"suggested_fix":"Print a `**Parent:** <uri> <path>/<step> (<relation>)` line after Base in each md header, and draw a `__parent__` node (labelled with path/step and relation) into root steps in the DOT renderer when `parent` is set.","summary":"Markdown and DOT renderers print base but drop path.parent, so a continuation's lineage is invisible in rendered output","tags":["review","review:pr-354-r1","session:claude-code:e7a0e4d4-d193-4368-8056-1808f5a5eacd"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/toolpath-md/src/lib.rs","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-07T16:27:24.925307Z","id":"b294bb08b5f403960f4245870ccc167f0232d13f91b40cbe699f06a57c53d445","body":{"detail":"`grep -n 'path\\.parent\\|\\.parent\\b' crates/toolpath-md/src/lib.rs crates/toolpath-dot/src/lib.rs | grep -v 'parent: None'` returns nothing: the only `parent` occurrences in both crates are struct-literal `parent: None` initialisers and `step.parents` edges. crates/toolpath-md/src/lib.rs:531-537 writes `**Base:**` from `path.path.base`; crates/toolpath-dot/src/lib.rs:93 and :131 draw `__base__` only.\n\n    ./target/debug/path p render md --input examples/path-05-continuation.path.json\n    # Claude Code session: Add service config (resumed)\n    **Base:** `file:///home/alex/projects/myrepo` @ `def789abc123456`\n    **Head:** `step-007`\n    **Source:** `agent://claude-code/session-xyz`\n    **Changes:** +9 −4 across 2 files\n    **Steps:** 6 | **Artifacts:** 2 | **Dead ends:** 0\n\nNo Parent line; the parent (path-session-xyz/step-003, continuation) declared in the example header is not rendered. `suggestion` is right: a feature gap in the renderers, not incorrect output.","kind":"comment","references":"6dbd5cfac6540847db9916b81eae44da65a563c093bb80ebd231228075a70ea5","summary":"confirmed: neither the Markdown nor the DOT renderer reads path.parent","tags":["verified:confirmed","session:claude-code:e7a0e4d4-d193-4368-8056-1808f5a5eacd"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/toolpath-md/src/lib.rs","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-07T18:21:05.887372Z","id":"48d935dbae9ac49887df4260215d11e7e3fca96c2de8edeba57fddf86d3e2d37","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:75f922d","summary":"crates/toolpath-md/src/lib.rs write_parent_line, called from write_path_context and write_transcript_context, plus parent/parent_path/parent_step in write_path_front_matter; crates/toolpath-dot/src/lib.rs render_path draws a __parent__ node and __parent__ -> root edges. Tests: toolpath-md test_render_path_with_parent, test_render_path_without_parent_has_no_parent_line, agent_coding_session_header_shows_parent; toolpath-dot test_render_path_with_parent, test_render_path_without_parent_has_no_parent_node. p render md on examples/path-05-continuation.path.json prints '**Parent:**  path  @ '.","supersedes":"6dbd5cfac6540847db9916b81eae44da65a563c093bb80ebd231228075a70ea5","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e7a0e4d4-d193-4368-8056-1808f5a5eacd"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/toolpath-md/src/lib.rs","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-07T18:21:46.777275Z","id":"372ec4fcf7edcebd2818c76a4dd138a54a1e182050e87787749920f933a20bbe","body":{"kind":"comment","ref":"git:75f922d","references":"48d935dbae9ac49887df4260215d11e7e3fca96c2de8edeba57fddf86d3e2d37","summary":"Correction to the resolution text, whose quoted output was eaten by the shell: p render md on examples/path-05-continuation.path.json prints `**Parent:** `file:///home/alex/.toolpath/path-02-local-session.path.json` path `path-session-xyz` @ `step-003`` as the second header line, after Base; p render dot draws `\"__parent__\" -> \"step-004\"`.","tags":["review:pr-354-r1","session:claude-code:e7a0e4d4-d193-4368-8056-1808f5a5eacd"]}}
